  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s prior-life sketch of Ma Hong Yun, a river accident carries the youth downstream while Sheng Ling Er is bathing. Sheng tribe rules force the genius female Gu Master into marriage with him. She then supplies him with Gu worms and primeval stones, and she steals her tribe’s precious Gu to raise his aptitude to A grade. When that theft is exposed, Sheng tribe leader secretly sends an expert to kill Ma Hong Yun; the expert dies on the way, and the pair still marry and hold an important place in the tribe. Jealous tribesmen plot against him, and he has no choice but to escape toward poison grassland.",
      "chapters": [
        441
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_ma_hong_yun",
        "fac_sheng_tribe",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That outline is memory of another timeline, not the grassland story the reader then watches unfold.",
      "chapters": [
        441
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the five regions battle of that prior life, Fang Yuan remembers Ma Hong Yun, Sheng Ling Er, and Zhao Lian Yun becoming Gu Immortals and standing as symbols of Northern Plains resistance against Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        503
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prior-life-standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another recall states that after Ma Hong Yun escapes Dong Fang tribe with secrets about three hearts combination soul, he and his wife Sheng Ling Er, a refinement path master, create nauseous crying baby Gu to counter that killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        507
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
